        coreEn: "A-side: The child's rebellion can also be proof of your success — you raised an independent will. Their no longer needing you means you completed your mission. / B-side: Being denied by the life you created — there is no deeper betrayal. Your love in their eyes isn't a gift but a shackle. Key tension: Did you give 'love' — or 'something you wanted in return'? | Real punctured: A child is not your extension — they are an independent subject. Your 'love' for them is sometimes just a projection of your ideal self-image.",
