        reference: "《情书》中通过书信揭开隐藏一生的暗恋真相；《公民凯恩》中至死低语'玫瑰花蕾'但无人理解其含义的报业大亨。",
        referenceEn: "A lifelong hidden love revealed through correspondence in Love Letter; the media mogul whispering 'Rosebud' to death with no one understanding its meaning in Citizen Kane.",

